flowchart TB
accTitle: How a new node catches up
accDescr: A saved snapshot is downloaded and restored onto the server disk. The node applies blocks made after the snapshot, then keeps applying new committed blocks.
snapshot[("Saved snapshot")]:::network
subgraph S["Your AWS server"]
 download["1 · Download the saved state"]:::service
 restore["2 · Restore onto disk"]:::service
 catchup["3 · Apply the missing blocks"]:::service
 live[("4 · Keep following new blocks")]:::data
end
snapshot --> download
 download --> restore --> catchup --> live
